        "original_id": "1b5a8d02-aca1-51dd-9183-7e5f632b18e4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Lightfoot, Ayisha Davies, Rupert Glasson, Ivan Milat, Bradley Murdoch\n- Films: Wolf Creek, Rogue, Coffin Rock, The Bloody Sweet Hit\n- Topics: film production, horror films, thriller films, marketing claims, true-crime inspirations\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1990s, Ivan Milat murdered tourists in crimes later cited as an influence on the plot of Wolf Creek.\n- In 2001, Bradley Murdoch committed a tourist murder later cited as an influence on the plot of Wolf Creek.\n- Wolf Creek was ambiguously marketed as being based on true events.\n- David Lightfoot worked on the horror films Wolf Creek and Rogue.\n- The Australian film Coffin Rock was directed by Rupert Glasson and produced by David Lightfoot.\n- Ayisha Davies is most famous for producing The Bloody Sweet Hit (2007) and Coffin Rock (2009).",
